    "steam_appid": 3418560,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/d35883a59591edfddb2d36b545d9f227.poster.avif?t=1748265826\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/d35883a59591edfddb2d36b545d9f227.webm?t=1748265826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/d35883a59591edfddb2d36b545d9f227.mp4?t=1748265826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash your Inner Truth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive a dark and twisted modern society alongside three cute yet crazy heroines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rising from Despair, unravel hidden mysteries, and overcome your fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/1d018f00810755df63ae622cbf3a6a0a.poster.avif?t=1748265826\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/1d018f00810755df63ae622cbf3a6a0a.webm?t=1748265826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/1d018f00810755df63ae622cbf3a6a0a.mp4?t=1748265826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>&quot;Inner Truth&quot; is set in the modern era and tells a story centered on social issues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The characters come from complex backgrounds\u2014congenital disabilities, drug and alcohol addiction, incest, codependency, and religious faith\u2014while the three heroines struggle with the line between good and evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, they must make painful choices, even at the cost of hurting those they love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Characters</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/a38561804ea0fc744ccf9ac6328a191f.avif?t=1748265826\" data-has-big width=800 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl with a congenital reading disorder who cannot read or write. One day, she finds a letter\u2014the very letter that sparked her parents' hatred for each other. Desperate to understand its contents, she embarks on a journey of discovery. Despite her struggles, she doesn\u2019t speak with words, but with actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/fbf1fc95b8b339b22bbdb8418690d375.avif?t=1748265826\" data-has-big width=800 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The daughter of Kirigakure Masanori, a once-feared political tyrant. She lived in luxury until her mother abandoned the family, sending her father into a downward spiral. With no one to rely on, her only comfort is the teddy bear her mother left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/4c2a6a758ab9b03a559f2b76cdca7a56.avif?t=1748265826\" data-has-big width=800 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl born into poverty. Abused by her twisted father and trapped in a codependent relationship with her mother, she longs for freedom\u2014but the curse of her family keeps her bound. The day she steals alcohol for her father is the day her fate begins to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/c196a07cbc02c65089efbf8d0d40da0b.poster.avif?t=1748265826\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/c196a07cbc02c65089efbf8d0d40da0b.webm?t=1748265826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/c196a07cbc02c65089efbf8d0d40da0b.mp4?t=1748265826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat unfolds in a turn-based system where resource management and sharp decision-making determine victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moving costs AP (Action Points), attacking uses SP (Spirit Points), and surviving requires HP (Hit Points).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the terrain to your advantage, build barricades, and make strategic use of items to outmaneuver your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When characters embrace their inner truth, they awaken\u2014unleashing special animations and powerful actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mindset System</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/c48b862f0c419dce01e6a96d6119cf33.poster.avif?t=1748265826\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/c48b862f0c419dce01e6a96d6119cf33.webm?t=1748265826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/c48b862f0c419dce01e6a96d6119cf33.mp4?t=1748265826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather scattered emotions from various places to strengthen your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Wrath&quot; enhances physical abilities but reduces intelligence and judgment, while &quot;Fear&quot; boosts agility at the expense of courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A biased mindset can grant tremendous power, but it may ultimately lead to your downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adults Are Not Perfect</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/87be8a410fbbe3b867af291a9c181de7.avif?t=1748265826\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Around the heroines, adults exist in shades of light and darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A past tainted by drug addiction, impulses they cannot resist, unwavering faith in God, an insatiable thirst for power, and secrets buried deep\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are they sinners beyond redemption, or merely flawed souls struggling to do good? It is up to you to decide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cutscenes</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/d78d42b8c88a0f0f8694ebc16a07c429.poster.avif?t=1748265826\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/d78d42b8c88a0f0f8694ebc16a07c429.webm?t=1748265826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/d78d42b8c88a0f0f8694ebc16a07c429.mp4?t=1748265826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic camera work, original animations that bring characters to life, and text woven like a novel\u2014these elements breathe intensity into the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique presentation inspired by gameplay, along with scenes influenced by classic films, may even bring moments of unexpected laughter.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/d35883a59591edfddb2d36b545d9f227.poster.avif?t=1748265826\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/d35883a59591edfddb2d36b545d9f227.webm?t=1748265826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/d35883a59591edfddb2d36b545d9f227.mp4?t=1748265826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash your Inner Truth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive a dark and twisted modern society alongside three cute yet crazy heroines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rising from Despair, unravel hidden mysteries, and overcome your fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/1d018f00810755df63ae622cbf3a6a0a.poster.avif?t=1748265826\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/1d018f00810755df63ae622cbf3a6a0a.webm?t=1748265826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/1d018f00810755df63ae622cbf3a6a0a.mp4?t=1748265826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>&quot;Inner Truth&quot; is set in the modern era and tells a story centered on social issues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The characters come from complex backgrounds\u2014congenital disabilities, drug and alcohol addiction, incest, codependency, and religious faith\u2014w