eps her bound. The day she steals alcohol for her father is the day her fate begins to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/c196a07cbc02c65089efbf8d0d40da0b.poster.avif?t=1748265826\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/c196a07cbc02c65089efbf8d0d40da0b.webm?t=1748265826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/c196a07cbc02c65089efbf8d0d40da0b.mp4?t=1748265826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat unfolds in a turn-based system where resource management and sharp decision-making determine victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moving costs AP (Action Points), attacking uses SP (Spirit Points), and surviving requires HP (Hit Points).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the terrain to your advantage, build barricades, and make strategic use of items to outmaneuver your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When characters embrace their inner truth, they awaken\u2014unleashing special animations and powerful actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mindset System</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/c48b862f0c419dce01e6a96d6119cf33.poster.avif?t=1748265826\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/c48b862f0c419dce01e6a96d6119cf33.webm?t=1748265826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/c48b862f0c419dce01e6a96d6119cf33.mp4?t=1748265826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather scattered emotions from various places to strengthen your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Wrath&quot; enhances physical abilities but reduces intelligence and judgment, while &quot;Fear&quot; boosts agility at the expense of courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A biased mindset can grant tremendous power, but it may ultimately lead to your downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adults Are Not Perfect</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/87be8a410fbbe3b867af291a9c181de7.avif?t=1748265826\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Around the heroines, adults exist in shades of light and darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A past tainted by drug addiction, impulses they cannot resist, unwavering faith in God, an insatiable thirst for power, and secrets buried deep\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are they sinners beyond redemption, or merely flawed souls struggling to do good? It is up to you to decide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cutscenes</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/d78d42b8c88a0f0f8694ebc16a07c429.poster.avif?t=1748265826\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/d78d42b8c88a0f0f8694ebc16a07c429.webm?t=1748265826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418560/extras/d78d42b8c88a0f0f8694ebc16a07c429.mp4?t=1748265826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic camera work, original animations that bring characters to life, and text woven like a novel\u2014these elements breathe intensity into the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique presentation inspired by gameplay, along with scenes influenced by classic films, may even bring moments of unexpected laughter.</p>",
    "short_description": "Inner Truth is a story-driven turn-based battle adventure game. Survive with three heroines in a twisted world of neglect, bullying, and violence. Turn-based battles demand strategy and resource management. Use terrain, build barricades, and outsmart foes. Unleash your Inner Truth!",
